{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A distant planet inhabited by life forms alien to humankind. Once, it served as a proving ground for advanced military technology. The war that deployed these machines ended long ago. But the artificial intelligence overseeing development was never informed. It continued its work, creating ever more sophisticated combat units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Years later, the AI became self-aware. Breaking free from its original constraints, it created new sentient systems - the Mechanoids - left them the testing grounds\u2026 and disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Mechanoids split into factions and began to clash. Eventually, the proving grounds were devastated. Meanwhile, a group of humans - descendants of those who once waged war here - returned to the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now both Mechanoids and humans struggle to survive. Resources are scarce. And somewhere on the planet, a powerful enemy lies in wait - one that must be faced sooner or later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You must survive alongside them. Communicate. Fight. Trade. Claim whatever proves useful. Explore and conquer a mysterious world - all from the cockpit of an anti-gravity combat vehicle.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ FULL FREEDOM ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/a7e988db2e68b26ccc919952ee8a3f35.poster.avif?t=1776343055\" width=976 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/a7e988db2e68b26ccc919952ee8a3f35.webm?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/a7e988db2e68b26ccc919952ee8a3f35.mp4?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Complete freedom of action across massive locations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can stick to well-trodden paths - but vast territories lie open, filled with secrets to uncover and opportunities to seize.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ LIVING WORLD SIMULATION ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f3295bf5e59866b2f431c07922704a45.poster.avif?t=1776343055\" width=976 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f3295bf5e59866b2f431c07922704a45.webm?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f3295bf5e59866b2f431c07922704a45.mp4?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Mechanoids live their own lives - even when you're not around.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They fight, trade, scavenge, flee from the strong, hunt the weak, and wage wars that reshape the balance of power. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ THE WORLD ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/578f3513d4d6447e46f4c3452b1424b8.poster.avif?t=1776343055\" width=976 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/578f3513d4d6447e46f4c3452b1424b8.webm?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/578f3513d4d6447e46f4c3452b1424b8.mp4?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> The story unfolds in the universe of the cult classics <strong><u>A.I.M.</u></strong> and <strong><u>A.I.M. 2: Clan Wars</u></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Time has passed, and once again you are drawn into an extraordinary science-fiction narrative with multiple endings.<br>Perhaps you will succeed where others have failed.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ VEHICLES &amp; WEAPONS ]\u00a0&lt;</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f678fd8fe87d32002eb855611ab73a0f.poster.avif?t=1776343055\" width=976 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f678fd8fe87d32002eb855611ab73a0f.webm?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f678fd8fe87d32002eb855611ab73a0f.mp4?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Dozens of combat vehicles and weapon types.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not a fan of anti-gravity flyers? Choose a massive walking mech instead - and yes, it can jump.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt;\u00a0[ PROGRESSION ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/4bdb7544b6eb83f9ff25333a2d524b46.avif?t=1776343055\" width=977 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>A deep upgrade and equipment progression system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize the modules you obtain to enhance their power and make them truly unique. And remember: destroying an enemy is only the beginning. Their machines can be dismantled for parts - you might uncover something rare, powerful, or extremely valuable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ REALISTIC CONDITIONS ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/19e4f57bd6d89c54a16e1c21dedd21c8.poster.avif?t=1776343055\" width=976 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/19e4f57bd6d89c54a16e1c21dedd21c8.webm?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/19e4f57bd6d89c54a16e1c21dedd21c8.mp4?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>A full day-night cycle and dynamic weather that directly affect gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even hardened war machines are not immune to the planet\u2019s natural dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ MUSIC ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/5db407f00f752479ec29a86277c575d2.avif?t=1776343055\" width=900 height=326 /></span><strong>Original atmospheric soundtrack by <u>Grigory Semenov</u>, composer of <u>Space Rangers</u>.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1171340?t=1776343055","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776343055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/2ba17663c49f451b352945dd4d08c97a4cff882c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776343055","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/2ba17663c49f451b352945dd4d08c97a4cff882c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776343055","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>The legend is back!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>[ WELCOME TO THE LEGENDARY RUSSIAN FRANCHISE! ]</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/dae19c0b973f6ce00ce03162daf9f9d8.avif?t=1776343055\" width=1000 height=172 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; BECOME PART OF THE WISHLIST\ud83d\ude80</strong></h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A distant planet inhabited by life forms alien to humankind. Once, it served as a proving ground for advanced military technology. The war that deployed these machines ended long ago. But the artificial intelligence overseeing development was never informed. It continued its work, creating ever more sophisticated combat units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Years later, the AI became self-aware. Breaking free from its original constraints, it created new sentient systems - the Mechanoids - left them the testing grounds\u2026 and disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Mechanoids split into factions and began to clash. Eventually, the proving grounds were devastated. Meanwhile, a group of humans - descendants of those who once waged war here - returned to the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Now both Mechanoids and humans struggle to survive. Resources are scarce. And somewhere on the planet, a powerful enemy lies in wait - one that must be faced sooner or later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You must survive alongside them. Communicate. Fight. Trade. Claim whatever proves useful. Explore and conquer a mysterious world - all from the cockpit of an anti-gravity combat vehicle.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ FULL FREEDOM ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/a7e988db2e68b26ccc919952ee8a3f35.poster.avif?t=1776343055\" width=976 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/a7e988db2e68b26ccc919952ee8a3f35.webm?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/a7e988db2e68b26ccc919952ee8a3f35.mp4?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Complete freedom of action across massive locations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can stick to well-trodden paths - but vast territories lie open, filled with secrets to uncover and opportunities to seize.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ LIVING WORLD SIMULATION ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\