have failed.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ VEHICLES &amp; WEAPONS ]\u00a0&lt;</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f678fd8fe87d32002eb855611ab73a0f.poster.avif?t=1776343055\" width=976 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f678fd8fe87d32002eb855611ab73a0f.webm?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/f678fd8fe87d32002eb855611ab73a0f.mp4?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Dozens of combat vehicles and weapon types.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Not a fan of anti-gravity flyers? Choose a massive walking mech instead - and yes, it can jump.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt;\u00a0[ PROGRESSION ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/4bdb7544b6eb83f9ff25333a2d524b46.avif?t=1776343055\" width=977 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>A deep upgrade and equipment progression system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize the modules you obtain to enhance their power and make them truly unique. And remember: destroying an enemy is only the beginning. Their machines can be dismantled for parts - you might uncover something rare, powerful, or extremely valuable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ REALISTIC CONDITIONS ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/19e4f57bd6d89c54a16e1c21dedd21c8.poster.avif?t=1776343055\" width=976 height=504 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/19e4f57bd6d89c54a16e1c21dedd21c8.webm?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/19e4f57bd6d89c54a16e1c21dedd21c8.mp4?t=1776343055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>A full day-night cycle and dynamic weather that directly affect gameplay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Even hardened war machines are not immune to the planet\u2019s natural dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&gt; [ MUSIC ] &lt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/extras/5db407f00f752479ec29a86277c575d2.avif?t=1776343055\" width=900 height=326 /></span><strong>Original atmospheric soundtrack by <u>Grigory Semenov</u>, composer of <u>Space Rangers</u>.</strong></p>","developers":["Bulat Dautov","SkyRiver Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1171340/410a613395dc2fda424a0b4dbcb6f8ac26435d44/header.jpg?t=1776343055","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1171340/692150254/61cb390ee88be64b89a468b3e43f550012404c2f/1772892062/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772892995","dash_h264":"https://video.akam